  "description": "Every business field carries its own value and evidence. case field_refs use case/subject; behavior field_refs use behaviors/0/action. Missing case information: null, corresponding unknowns entry, and nonempty uncertainty. legal_basis is an identified legal provision, never the case reason. position retains the entire stated institution and job. penalties preserves attribution and aggregate amounts. action excludes penalties. risk_tags require every defining condition; zero tags is allowed. hold/no_change have case=null and behaviors=[]; preserve the reason and cover every source segment, with no mapped fields. These actions cannot be approved as changes. position is only an explicitly stated appointment/job with its institution, never the party name alone; if no position is stated use null. Each independently described conduct should have its own behavior; do not conflate distinct actions under one tag set. A composite penalties value needs sufficient evidence for every component."
}
